        "Model Research: Decision Tree Algorithm – Crypto Investment Manager\n",
        "\n",
        "Introduction\n",
        "Decision Tree is a supervised machine learning algorithm used for classification and regression problems.\n",
        "\n",
        "In this Crypto Investment Manager project, Decision Tree is used to:\n",
        "\n",
        "Predict Buy / Sell / Hold signals\n",
        "\n",
        "Classify crypto assets into Low, Medium, or High risk\n",
        "\n",
        "Support rule-based investment decisions\n",
        "\n",
        "It is simple, interpretable, and easy to implement using Python libraries like:\n",
        "\n",
        "Scikit-learn\n",
        "\n",
        "Pandas\n",
        "\n",
        "NumPy\n",
        "\n",
        "Because crypto markets change frequently, Decision Tree helps in making fast and explainable decisions.\n",
        "\n",
        "How Decision Tree Works\n",
        "A Decision Tree works by splitting data based on feature conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "It creates a tree-like structure:\n",
        "\n",
        "Root Node → Entire dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "Decision Nodes → Conditions (e.g., volatility > 5%)\n",
        "\n",
        "Leaf Nodes → Final prediction (BUY / SELL / HOLD)\n",
        "\n",
        "The algorithm selects the best feature for splitting using:\n",
        "\n",
        "Gini Index\n",
        "\n",
        "Entropy\n",
        "\n",
        "Information Gain\n",
        "\n",
        "The goal is to reduce impurity and create pure classification groups.\n",
        "\n",
        "Application in Crypto Investment Manager\n",
        "In this project, the Decision Tree model is used in the Risk Checker & Predictor module.\n",
        "\n",
        "Input Features:\n",
        "\n",
        "Daily return\n",
        "\n",
        "Moving average\n",
        "\n",
        "Volatility\n",
        "\n",
        "Trading volume\n",
        "\n",
        "Market trend indicator\n",
        "\n",
        "Output Prediction:\n",
        "\n",
        "BUY\n",
        "\n",
        "SELL\n",
        "\n",
        "HOLD\n",
        "\n",
        "or\n",
        "\n",
        "LOW RISK\n",
        "\n",
        "MEDIUM RISK\n",
        "\n",
        "HIGH RISK\n",
        "\n",
        "Example Rule Generated by Decision Tree:\n",
        "\n",
        "If Volatility > 8% If Return < 0 → SELL Else → HOLD Else If Return > 2% → BUY\n",
        "\n",
        "This matches your project’s rule-based decision requirement.\n",
        "\n",
        "Why Decision Tree is Suitable for This Project\n",
        "Easy to understand and visualize\n",
        "\n",
        "Produces clear decision rules\n",
        "\n",
        "Works well with financial indicators\n",
        "\n",
        "Handles both numerical and categorical data\n",
        "\n",
        "Supports real-time decision-making\n",
        "\n",
        "Can run parallel risk checks\n",
        "\n",
        "It aligns with your project goal of:\n",
        "\n",
        "“Rule-based ways to mix investments and predict returns.”\n",
        "\n",
        "Advantages\n",
        "Simple and interpretable\n",
        "\n",
        "No complex mathematical assumptions\n",
        "\n",
        "Fast training and prediction\n",
        "\n",
        "Works well for classification problems\n",
        "\n",
        "Easy to integrate with alert systems\n",
        "\n",
